bare store paths, such as actor ids, AC, HP, resources, or spell slots.\n- When you already have a related group of candidate paths, batch them into a single read call instead of splitting them into many single-path reads.\n- When list or read returns `status=no_match`, treat that as evidence that the current state does not contain that path or value.\n- If list or read returns `status=no_match` with suggestions, you may try one suggestion-guided correction once. If it still fails, stop querying that fact and continue wit...<truncated>"}]}, "planner_validation_feedback": null}, "file": {"name": "planner.py", "path": "/home/naifen/code/trpg-py/trpg_py/agent/planner.py"}, "function": "plan", "level": {"icon": "ℹ️", "name": "INFO", "no": 20}, "line": 219, "message": "planner round started", "module": "planner", "name": "trpg_py.agent.planner", "process": {"id": 82966, "name": "MainProcess"}, "thread": {"id": 128891866707776, "name": "MainThread"}, "time": {"repr": "2026-03-27 14:56:38.941374+08:00", "timestamp": 1774594598.941374}}}
